      "explanation": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.006ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 1770.6 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1367,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> gets oxidised in presence of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.004ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 3979.7 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4B\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(811,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1214.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"72\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-72\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1147,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(2765.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(811,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and it converts to <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.048ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.753ex\" height=\"2.089ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -902.3 2100.7 923.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"72\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-72\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1147,432.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> in presence of dil. <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.69ex\" height=\"1.934ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 2957.1 855\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-wi