 </text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> can also get oxidized to sulphur.\n<br><br>\nHowever, most appropriate is (A) Sulphur dioxide."
